'ep.nota':'Production and energy come from different sources with different coverage. Each row states how many months were observed on each side and what was annualised. Nothing is converted between units. When a company runs more than one mineral, the load is split by what CCEE itself declares — activity branch and municipality — never by an arbitrary share; and when neither branch nor municipality separates them, as with co-products of the same mill, nothing is split and the coefficient carries the whole energy of the operation.',
